          "source": "",
          "thread": "Safe Wallet native integration",
          "why": "Embedding CoW Swap directly into Safe{Wallet} signals CoW graduating from optional aggregator to default smart-account infrastructure, which readers recognized as a distribution moat more durable than market-share statistics."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Fee switch revenue capture",
          "why": "Whether CoW could monetize $33B+ in cumulative volume without distorting solver competition is a live DAO-sustainability question that drew readers tracking the gap between protocol usage and token value accrual."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "CoW AMM LVR resistance design",
          "why": "The FM-AMM and CoW AMM work targeting loss-versus-rebalancing attracted readers who see LVR as the last major unsolved MEV problem for on-chain liquidity providers."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Aave revenue diversion dispute",
          "why": "Accusations that CoW swap fees generated inside Aave were not flowing to the Aave DAO lit up governance-watchers tracking how cross-protocol integrations create silent revenue-routing conflicts."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Encrypted order MEV protection",
          "why": "The FairyCoW encrypted-order collaboration with Fairblock and Anagram told readers that frontrunning protection on CoW's order flow was moving from research promise to live product."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "L2 expansion and market share race",
          "why": "The Arbitrum deployment and the 26% DEX aggregator share story together framed CoW shifting from Ethereum-native niche to a credible multi-chain 1inch challenger."
        }
      ]
